   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SSG105 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbooks: <strong>Teamwork Skills in University</strong>; <strong>Business Communication for Success</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14127 · Decision 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 09/04/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SSG105 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Teamwork Skills in University</strong>; <strong>Business Communication for Success</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14127 · QĐ 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 09/04/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Teamwork Skills in University</strong></td><td>Jamie Verschoor; Vanshika Kesar; Rebekah Lin; and Prabhdeep Randay</td><td>Kwantlen Polytechnic University</td><td>2022</td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://kpu.pressbooks.pub/teamworkinuniversity/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://kpu.pressbooks.pub/teamworkinuniversity/</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Business Communication for Success</strong></td><td>Southern Alberta Institute of Technology (SAIT)</td><td>Southern Alberta Institute of Technology (SAIT)</td><td>2021</td><td></td><td><code>978-1-55195-459-2</code></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://pressbooks.openeducationalberta.ca/saitbusinesscommunication/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://pressbooks.openeducationalberta.ca/saitbusinesscommunication/</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Blueprint for Success in College and Career</strong></td><td>Dave Dillon</td><td>Rebus Community</td><td>2021</td><td></td><td><code>978-1-989014-15-8</code></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://press.rebus.community/blueprint2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://press.rebus.community/blueprint2/</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Working in group 7th ed.</strong></td><td></td><td>Pearson</td><td>2017</td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Business communication 7th ed.</strong></td><td></td><td>Thomson-South Western</td><td>2008</td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>- Internet</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>- Internet</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14127</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14127</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
